/video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/20900/1303/42a0241b6f3b70fdf405398b1601bb9856540710/1750484653/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447351466","mp4":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam/apps/5089/movie480.mp4"}],"genres":["Action","RPG"],"features":["Single-player","Steam Cloud","Family Sharing"],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"controller":null,"dev":["CD PROJEKT RED"],"pub":["CD PROJEKT RED","1C-SoftClub"],"released":"Sep 19, 2008","meta":86,"langs":["English","French","German","Spanish - Spain","Italian","Czech","Russian","Hungarian","Polish","Traditional Chinese (text only)"],"min":[["Supported OS","Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae /XP/Vista"],["DirectX Version","DirectX 9.0c (included) or higher"],["Processor","Intel Pentium 4 2.4 GHz or Athlon 64 +2800 (Intel Pentium 4 3.0 GHz or AMD Athlon 64 +3000 recommended). Athlon XP series, such as the Athlon XP +2400, is not supported"],["Graphics","NVIDIA GeForce 6600 or ATI Radeon 9800 or better (NVIDIA GeForce 7800 GTX or ATI Radeon X1950 XT or better recommended)"],["Memory","1 GB RAM (2 GB RAM recommended)"],["Sound","DirectX version 9.0c-compatible sound card"],["Hard Drive","15 GB Free"]],"rec":[],"deck":2,"blurb":"Few choices are clearly right in The Witcher, a single-player RPG set in a grim fantasy world. The player is Geralt of Rivia, a professional monster slayer pulled into a power struggle among rival factions. Quests branch depending on decisions, and consequences often surface long after the choice was made. Characters develop through a large pool of skills, combat styles and magic, and fights unfold in real time with a tactical emphasis.\n\nThis Enhanced Edition Director's Cut is a revised release of CD Projekt RED's 2008 original. It is a dialogue-heavy, story-first game, suited to players who prefer moral ambiguity and lasting consequences to fast action."}}